    {"R":0,"ombre":["Fuu-ki","Bicorn","Hanuman","Anubis"],"q":"A bad rep spreads like wildfire. If I were you, I'd quit all this nonsense. What's the point?","risposte":[
      {"n":1,"t":"You're right.","c":["O","G","G","G"]},
      {"n":2,"t":"I don't care.","c":["G","-","-","o"]},
      {"n":3,"t":"I don't know any other way.","c":["G","o","b","g"]}]},
    {"R":1,"ombre":["Isis","Queen_Mab","Sarasvati"],"q":"After all, isn't it not pitiable when one denies one's own feelings?","risposte":[
      {"n":1,"t":"It is a difficult topic.","c":["G","-","-","-"]},
      {"n":2,"t":"But the outcome is clear.","c":["-","-","-","-"]},
      {"n":3,"t":"It's mature to admit defeat.","c":["-","G","-","o"]}]},
    {"R":2,"ombre":["Jatayu","Kali","Rangda","Skadi","Alilat"],"q":"After confronting me like this... Are you that kind of human too?","risposte":[
      {"n":1,"t":"That's not my style.","c":["O","G","-","-"]},
      {"n":2,"t":"What's wrong with that?","c":["-","B","G","-"]},
      {"n":3,"t":"So what?","c":["G","G","-","-"]}]},
    {"R":3,"ombre":["Kurama_Tengu","Barong","Nebiros","Oberon","Skadi"],"q":"Ah, it's a shame. If I'd taken this seriously from the start, I wouldn't be in this sorry state.","risposte":[
      {"n":1,"t":"Then get serious now.","c":["g","O","-","-"]},
      {"n":2,"t":"Making excuses?","c":["o","G","-","-"]},
      {"n":3,"t":"I wasn't trying either.","c":["b","O","G","G"]}]},
    {"R":4,"ombre":["Obariyon","Agathion","Onmoraki","Cait_Sith"],"q":"Ain't people your age suppose'ta be out on dates and stuff instead?","risposte":[
      {"n":1,"t":"Right after this, kid.","c":["-","-","O","G"]},
      {"n":2,"t":"Such a rude little boy...","c":["-","O","-","O"]},
      {"n":3,"t":"Dating's not important.","c":["G","G","G","G"]}]},
    {"R":5,"ombre":["Oberon","Dionysus"],"q":"And if that's the case, why don't you just stop this futile endeavor? It's meaningless...","risposte":[
      {"n":1,"t":"You have a point there...","c":["-","-","-","-"]},
      {"n":2,"t":"I can't stop.","c":["-","G","-","-"]},
      {"n":3,"t":"I'll find meaning in it.","c":["-","-","-","G"]}]},
    {"R":6,"ombre":["Bicorn","Atavaka","Fuu-ki","Ippon-Datara","Forneus","Chernobog","Mara","Fafnir","Hanuman"],"q":"Are all the kids these days doin' stuff like this?","risposte":[
